    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n#   Datasets:⟨3⟩\n* * *\nDuplicated from chainyo/rvl-cdip⟨28⟩\n![⟨29⟩]\n ![](https://huggingface.co/avatars/2986edd4d2f3b76bc8be1b1ac0a6c7ed.svg) ⟨30⟩\nChan814⟨30⟩\n/\nrvl-cdip⟨31⟩\nlike 0\nModalities:  Image ⟨32⟩\nFormats:  parquet ⟨33⟩\nSize:  100K - 1M ⟨34⟩\nLibraries:  Datasets ⟨35⟩ Dask ⟨36⟩ Polars ⟨37⟩ + 1\nLicense:\nother\n Dataset card ⟨31⟩ Data Studio ⟨38⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨39⟩ Community 1 ⟨40⟩\nDataset Viewer\n Auto-converted to Parquet⟨41⟩ API Embed  Duplicate⟨42⟩ Data Studio\nSubset (1)\ndefault · 400k rows\ndefault (400k rows)\nSplit (3)\ntrain · 320k rows\ntrain (320k rows) val (40k rows) test (40k rows)\nSearch is not available for this dataset\nSQL\nConsole\nThe dataset viewer is not available for this split.\nParquet error: Scan size limit exceeded: attempted to read 493339602 bytes, limit is 300000000 bytes Make sure that 1. the Parquet files contain a page index to enable random access without loading entire row groups2. otherwise use smaller row-group sizes when serializing the Parquet files \n\n```\nError code:   TooBigContentError\n\n```\n\nNeed help to make the dataset viewer work? Make sure to review how to configure the dataset viewer⟨43⟩, and open a discussion⟨44⟩ for direct support.\n  * Labels⟨45⟩\n  * Citation⟨46⟩\n  * License⟨47⟩\n  * References⟨48⟩\n\n\nThe RVL-CDIP (Ryerson Vision Lab Complex Document Information Processing) dataset consists of 400,000 grayscale images in 16 classes, with 25,000 images per class. There are 320,000 training images, 40,000 validation images, and 40,000 test images. The images are sized so their largest dimension does not exceed 1000 pixels.\nFor questions and comments please contact Adam Harley (aharley@scs.ryerson.ca).\nThe full dataset can be found here⟨49⟩.\n##   ⟨45⟩ Labels \n0: advertissement  \n1: budget  \n2: email  \n3: file folder  \n4: form  \n5: handwritten  \n6: invoice  \n7: letter  \n8: memo  \n9: news article  \n10: presentation  \n11: questionnaire  \n12: resume  \n13: scientific publication  \n14: scientific report  \n15: specification \n##   ⟨46⟩ Citation \nThis dataset is from this paper⟨50⟩ `A. W. Harley, A. Ufkes, K. G. Derpanis, \"Evaluation of Deep Convolutional Nets for Document Image Classification and Retrieval,\" in ICDAR, 2015`\n##   ⟨47⟩ License \nRVL-CDIP is a subset of IIT-CDIP, which came from the Legacy Tobacco Document Library⟨51⟩, for which license information can be found here⟨52⟩.\n##   ⟨48⟩ References \n  1. D. Lewis, G. Agam, S. Argamon, O. Frieder, D. Grossman, and J. Heard, \"Building a test collection for complex document information processing,\" in Proc. 29th Annual Int. ACM SIGIR Conference (SIGIR 2006), pp. 665-666, 2006\n  2. The Legacy Tobacco Document Library (LTDL), University of California, San Francisco, 2007. <http://legacy.library.ucsf.edu/>.\n\n\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    302\nNumber of rows: 399,999 Total file size: 45.7 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨53⟩ Privacy⟨54⟩ About⟨55⟩ Careers⟨56⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
